    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In WASD Quartet, you will live a journey to a city full of mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll explore a city full of robots. Walking in the streets, will you be able to find the hidden secrets ?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Play music</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll need to play music to progress through the story. Timing and notes will be your allies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Create your own musics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Music isn't always following a guide. Feel free to create your own musics. </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In WASD Quartet, you will live a journey to a city full of mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll explore a city full of robots. Walking in the streets, will you be able to find the hidden secrets ?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Play music</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll need to play music to progress through the story. Timing and notes will be your allies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Create your own musics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Music isn't always following a guide. Feel free to create your own musics. </p>",
